estcontainers-java/issues/events/3382564100","actor":{"login":"quincy","id":430449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDQ0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/430449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy","html_url":"https://github.com/quincy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quincy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"9621fca31d4f3497721754ba421a8ada06ce53b9","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quincy/testcontainers-java/commits/9621fca31d4f3497721754ba421a8ada06ce53b9","created_at":"2020-05-28T12:33:36Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/827443170","html_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/1799#issuecomment-827443170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/1799","id":827443170,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyNzQ0MzE3MA==","user":{"login":"tazle","id":681203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTIwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle","html_url":"https://github.com/tazle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-27T09:00:52Z","updated_at":"2021-04-27T09:01:01Z","body":"So, the overall solution in TestContainers appears to to parse the Dockerfile and pre-pull.\r\n\r\nWe have some image builds that take the base image as build arg, and the current parsing doesn't account for that. For docker configurations without *credsStore*, the builds still work for us (probably because something in the TestContainers global docker client injects the X-Auth-Config information to the build POST request, but we haven't actually verified that yet).\r\n\r\nI think I understand why the pre-pull route is necessary for docker-compose, but could there be an option to disable it for the normal case?\r\n\r\nOverall idea is to add an option to: 1) Disable pre-pull, 2) pass all the available credentials to the build command.\r\n\r\nThe alternative, to support base-image-as-build-args, would be to parse build args. Do you think that approach would be better?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/827443170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tazle","id":681203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTIwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tazle","html_url":"https://github.com/tazle","followers_url":"https://api.g